---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ESG & Sustainability Statement — HarvTech"
  description="HARVTECH LTD environmental, social and governance commitments — our approach to sustainability, social responsibility and governance as a UK technology consultancy."
>
  <section class="container-page py-20">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-4">Responsibility</p>
    <h1 class="title-display mb-4 hero-gradient leading-tight">ESG &amp; Sustainability Statement</h1>
    <p class="body-muted text-sm">Last updated: June 2026 · Reviewed annually</p>
    <p class="mt-4">
      <a href="/policies/harvtech-esg-sustainability-statement.pdf" class="text-primary hover:underline text-sm" rel="noopener" target="_blank">
        Download PDF
      </a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="border-border-faintest border-t">
    <div class="container-page py-16">
      <div class="prose-policy max-w-3xl space-y-10">

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            HARVTECH LTD (&ldquo;HarvTech&rdquo;, &ldquo;we&rdquo;, &ldquo;us&rdquo;) is a UK-based technology and Azure
            platform engineering consultancy. Although we are a small organisation, we believe that
            operating responsibly &mdash; for the environment, for people, and through sound governance
            &mdash; is fundamental to the way we work and to the trust our clients place in us. This
            statement sets out our approach and our commitments.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">1. Our approach</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            As a lean, digitally-native consultancy we have a naturally low environmental footprint.
            Rather than treat ESG as a reporting exercise, we focus on practical, proportionate actions
            that we can genuinely deliver as a business of our size, and we will scale our commitments as
            the company grows.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">2. Environmental responsibility</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We are committed to minimising the environmental impact of our operations. In practice this
            means:
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {[
              'Operating as a remote-first, paperless business to avoid the emissions and waste associated with fixed office space and commuting.',
              'Preferring cloud and hosting providers that publish renewable-energy and net-zero commitments.',
              'Extending the life of IT hardware and disposing of redundant equipment responsibly through certified WEEE recycling channels.',
              'Minimising business travel and defaulting to remote collaboration; choosing lower-carbon options where travel is unavoidable.',
              'Building software and advising clients in ways that favour efficient, sustainable use of computing resources.',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm">
                <span class="text-primary mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true" />
                <span class="body-muted leading-relaxed">{item}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <div class="bg-bg-2 rounded-lg p-5 space-y-2">
            <p class="text-text-primary text-sm font-semibold">Emissions measurement</p>
            <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              HarvTech has not yet formally baselined its Scope 1, 2 and 3 greenhouse-gas emissions. Given
              our remote, equipment-light operating model our direct (Scope 1) and energy (Scope 2)
              emissions are minimal. We intend to introduce simple emissions tracking and, as the business
              grows, to set a reduction pathway aligned with the UK&rsquo;s net-zero ambitions.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">3. Social responsibility</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            People &mdash; our clients, our future colleagues, and the communities we work in &mdash; are
            central to our business. We are committed to:
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {[
              'Treating everyone we work with fairly, respectfully and without discrimination of any kind.',
              'Upholding human rights and fair labour practices across our own operations and supply chain (see our Modern Slavery Statement and Supplier Code of Conduct).',
              'Protecting client and personal data in line with UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018, and maintaining strong information-security practices.',
              'Supporting continuous professional development and, as we grow, building an inclusive, flexible workplace from the outset.',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm">
                <span class="text-primary mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true" />
                <span class="body-muted leading-relaxed">{item}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">4. Governance</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We hold ourselves to high standards of integrity and legal compliance. This includes:
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            {[
              'Complying with all applicable UK laws and regulations relevant to our business.',
              'Maintaining a zero-tolerance approach to bribery and corruption, consistent with the Bribery Act 2010.',
              'Identifying and managing conflicts of interest transparently.',
              'Maintaining appropriate professional indemnity and public liability insurance.',
              'Keeping clear, accurate records and meeting our obligations to Companies House and HMRC.',
            ].map((item) => (
              <div class="flex gap-4 text-sm">
                <span class="text-primary mt-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 flex-shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current" aria-hidden="true" />
                <span class="body-muted leading-relaxed">{item}</span>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">5. Disclosure standards</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            HarvTech is a small enterprise and falls below the size thresholds that bring companies into
            scope of formal sustainability disclosure frameworks such as the ISSB standards (IFRS S1/S2),
            the TCFD recommendations, the EU Corporate Sustainability Reporting Directive (CSRD) and the EU
            Corporate Sustainability Due Diligence Directive (CSDDD). We therefore do not currently report
            against these standards. We monitor developments in sustainability reporting and aim to align
            with their underlying principles &mdash; transparency, accountability and proportionate due
            diligence &mdash; where it is practical for a business of our size to do so.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card p-8 space-y-4">
          <h2 class="title-card text-lg">6. Review</h2>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            This statement is reviewed at least annually, and sooner if there is a material change to our
            business, and is approved by the director of HARVTECH LTD.
          </p>
          <p class="body-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Approved by <span class="text-text-hero font-medium">Alex Harvey</span>, Director, HARVTECH LTD.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
